{"agent":"fleet-unblock-b","data":{"body":"Twelve evaluation tasks and fifty acceptance tasks each build their own fixtures; one harness gives a fixture registry, a standard fake kit, a miss-rate report per workflow and the rule that a workflow is enabled by default only after it catches its planted set; extends the live-recorded fixtures (B-ac-fixtures).\n\nCONFORMANCE (D-universal-principles, rules r-everything-configurable, r-everything-managed, r-reuse-core): every number is a knob settable by file, CLI, MCP and prompt; every definition this task adds (kind, template, gate, lens, role, lint set, importer, pack, job) is a record kind under the record contract RC1-RC12 (add, edit, remove as a tombstone, review and history, search, recall and RAG export, logged events and replay restore); every shipped default is overridable per project and per org; search for an existing function and extend the shared engines (P-shared-engines) instead of writing a second one; files under 20 KB.\n\nSplit into: SE-eval-harness.1, SE-eval-harness.2, SE-eval-harness.3."},"id":"eaffec61a11a9144b29fc5271","kind":"task.updated","lamport":79700,"schema":1,"subject":"SE-eval-harness","ts":"2026-10-18T08:19:04.980726Z"}
